Package: readout
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, pci.ids, systemd, hicolor-icon-theme
Suggests: network-manager, upower, bluez, udisks2
Description: system monitor service for the Plasma and GNOME panels
 readoutd is a small session D-Bus service that reads CPU, memory, disk,
 network, GPU, sensor, battery and Bluetooth statistics for the Readout panel
 widgets. It reads only what is on screen, starts on demand and exits when
 unused. This package also contains the readoutctl command-line client.

Package: plasma-widget-readout
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, readout (= ${binary:Version}),
         qml6-module-org-kde-quickcharts, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami, qml6-module-org-kde-kcmutils,
         qml6-module-org-kde-notifications, plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.4)
Description: Readout system monitor widget for KDE Plasma
 Panel widget for KDE Plasma 6 showing CPU, memory, disk, network, GPU,
 sensors, battery, Bluetooth and world clocks, with detailed popups and alerts.

Package: gnome-shell-extension-readout
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, readout (>= ${source:Version}), gnome-shell (>= 48)
Description: Readout system monitor for GNOME Shell
 GNOME Shell extension showing CPU, memory, disk, network, GPU, sensors,
 battery, Bluetooth and world clocks in the top bar, with detailed popups.
